OL,3,ANvidia CEO Jensen Huang resigns after
OL,4,Atech giant rocked by second affair
OL,5,Aallegation
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang has resigned as CEO of
OL,8,Ftech giant Nvidia, the company's board
OL,9,Fsays
OL,11,FStocks in the firm plummeted again
OL,12,Fafter the New York Times reported that
OL,13,FHuang had a second affair with an
OL,14,Fexecutive at his own company
OL,16,FUS markets will open again at 14:30 GMT
OL,17,F(09:30 ET), with pre-market trading
OL,18,Fshowing Nvidia's shares down 10%
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
